text ThreeIsland_Mart_Text_TrueThatCeldadonDeptStoreBigger {
    "Is it true?\p"
    "Celadon Dept. Store is several\n"
    "times bigger than this shop?$"
}

text ThreeIsland_Mart_Text_PeopleHealWithBerriesFromForest {
    "I sometimes buy medicine here.\p"
    "But a lot of people heal Pokémon\n"
    "with Berries from Berry Forest.\p"
    "After all, Berries are free and\n"
    "they never run out.$"
}

text ThreeIsland_Mart_Text_BikersWereAboutToTrashMart {
    "Those Bikers were about to trash\n"
    "this Pokémon Mart.\p"
    "Am I glad they decided to leave!$"
}
